WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Soft, original harmonic ambience. Individual fibre lines gather into a textured roving.]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[The layered fibres remain still as the camera drifts slowly across their irregular edges.]

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[Fine fibres converge into a twisting continuous strand. Original designed thread-rustle ambience.]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
[The strand continues twisting towards a stylized wooden spindle.]

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Parallel warp threads stretch across a loom-inspired frame. A shuttle-shaped form carries weft across them.]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
[The shuttle travels along the crossing threads. Quiet electronic rhythmic accents accompany the motion.]

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
[Close-up of a completed woven surface, its raised strands catching a shifting warm light.]

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
[The light traverses the woven cloth. The original harmonic ambience fades quietly.]